        "Content": "•\tDetached 4-bedroom bungalow\r\n•\tPresented in excellent order\r\n•\tLight filled interiors extending to 238sq.m. / 2,556sq.ft.\r\n•\tNew roof and gutters in 2016\r\n•\tSolid doors and floors\r\n•\tGFCH with upgraded boiler\r\n•\tNewcastle Design kitchen\r\n•\tMunster Joinery double glazed windows and doors\r\n•\tStira staircase to the attic providing generous storage\r\n•\tWrap around gardens with an all-day sunny orientation\r\n•\tLeisurely stroll to the village\r\n•\tFitted blinds and appliances are included in the sale"
